  "before_interfaces": {
    "lem-knot-admits-morse-height-representative": [
      "## Statement\n\nIdentify the oriented standard $S^3$ with the unit sphere in $\\mathbb R^4$ and fix $h(x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4)=x_4$. For every smooth oriented knot $K\\subset S^3$, there is an orientation-preserving ambient isotopy carrying $K$ to a smooth knot $K'$ for which $h|_{K'}$ has only nondegenerate critical points."
